  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe WCS page has four feature rows: Origin, X axis, Y axis and Z axis.\nEach row has its own Pick and Clear controls and shows the feature name.\nApply and Clear sit below the table.\nApply uses the existing validation and one undoable `SetWcs` command.\n\nBefore:\n\n![Before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/fb5af5c2198141b13c491ce13b9b915a812c63c0/2625/before.png)\n\nAfter:\n\n![After](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/fb5af5c2198141b13c491ce13b9b915a812c63c0/2625/after.png)\n\n## Cause\n\nThe circle-centre and anchor pick modes could stay armed when WCS feature picking started.\nThese modes took viewport clicks before the role draft received them.\nStarting a role pick now stops both modes.\n\n## Tests\n\nEffort: medium.\n\nThese pins failed before the fix:\n\n- `role_picking_stops_circle_picks`\n- `role_picking_stops_anchor_picks`\n- `each_role_button_routes_viewport_features_to_its_own_row`\n\nThe first two pins fail again with the old arming code.\nThe third pin fails again with the old row code.\nAll pass with the fix restored.\nThe third pin checks real viewport face, edge and corner picks for every role.\n\n`picked_items_never_show_hex_ids_and_keep_one_name_across_pages` checks every accepted feature kind in every role.\n`role_picks_land_in_the_draft_and_apply_queues_one_undoable_setwcs` checks the WCS result, undo and redo.\n`parallel_axis_picks_show_the_refusal_and_do_not_move_the_wcs` checks conflicting axes.\nThe role-button pin also checks replacement, row clearing and Clear.\nThe WCS page, Setup page and WCS layout tests pass.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes all nine steps.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passes without warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The issue diff changes no `.nc`, `.cl` or snapshot PNG files.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo CNC machine or manual desktop session was used.\nThe tests and screenshots use synthetic models in the headless UI harness.\nThe branch starts at `upstream/main` commit `1ae4d061f`.\nLater upstream merges are not included in this branch.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone found in the file checks before the claim.\n\nChangelog: The WCS page has separate feature pick controls for Origin, X, Y and Z, and stops competing pick modes.\n\nFixes #2625\n",
